However, in the cases DELETE, MKCOL, MKCALENDAR, MOVE, and PROPPATCH, this path points to `collections/collection-root`, instead of `collections/collection-root/user/collection/item.ics`

This should be implemented for DELETE, MKCOL, MKCALENDAR, MOVE, and PROPPATCH.

This issue seems to be that many calls to `StoragePartLock.acquire_lock()` don't include the path.
